# Empty can / canned corn — 8-segment cylinder. radius 0.15, height 0.4,
# origin at the base center. Both EmptyCansBox and CannedCornBox prefabs
# share this mesh; only the albedo texture differs.
#
# Authored by hand. UVs wrap once around the side (front-seam at u=0/1)
# and the caps sample from texture center.

# Positions: 1..8 bottom rim (CCW from +X around +Y), 9..16 top rim,
# 17 bottom center, 18 top center.
v  0.150 0.000  0.000
v  0.106 0.000  0.106
v  0.000 0.000  0.150
v -0.106 0.000  0.106
v -0.150 0.000  0.000
v -0.106 0.000 -0.106
v  0.000 0.000 -0.150
v  0.106 0.000 -0.106
v  0.150 0.400  0.000
v  0.106 0.400  0.106
v  0.000 0.400  0.150
v -0.106 0.400  0.106
v -0.150 0.400  0.000
v -0.106 0.400 -0.106
v  0.000 0.400 -0.150
v  0.106 0.400 -0.106
v  0.000 0.000  0.000
v  0.000 0.400  0.000

# UVs: 1..9 bottom row (u 0..1), 10..18 top row (u 0..1), 19 cap-center.
